# Landing Page

Here's a clean, responsive landing page you can customize:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ProductName — Tagline Here</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }
  header {
    position: sticky; top: 0; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  }
  .logo { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  nav a { margin-left: 1.5rem; text-decoration: none; color: #555; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  nav a:hover { color: #000; }

  .hero {
    text-align: center; padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .hero p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .cta {
    display: inline-block; background: #000; color: #fff; padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .cta:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  .features {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem; max-width: 1000px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 2rem;
  }
  .feature h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .feature p { color: #666; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .icon { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }

  footer {
    text-align: center; padding: 3rem 2rem; color: #999; font-size: 0.875rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-top: 4rem;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">ProductName</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#features">Features</a>
    <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Build something people love.</h1>
  <p>A concise tagline explaining the value your product delivers to customers in one clear sentence.</p>
  <a href="#" class="cta">Get Started Free</a>
</section>

<section class="features" id="features">
  <div class="feature">
    <div class="icon">⚡</div>
    <h3>Fast</h3>
    <p>Blazing performance out of the box with zero configuration needed.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature">
    <div class="icon">🔒</div>
    <h3>Secure</h3>
    <p>Enterprise-grade security baked into every layer by default.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature">
    <div class="icon">🎯</div>
    <h3>Simple</h3>
    <p>A clean interface that lets you focus on what actually matters.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2025 ProductName. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
```

**To customize:**
- Replace `ProductName`, headline, and tagline
- Swap the CTA link and button text
- Add sections (pricing, testimonials, FAQ) between features and footer
- Adjust the black/white palette to your brand colors

